Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.31,0:00:07.36,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}11{\fs68}月 兹维列夫第一次站上世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:10.38,TL,,0,0,0,,却在巴黎输掉了登顶后的第一场球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.38,0:00:13.86,TL,,0,0,0,,他带去都灵的 是怎样一个赛季？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.31,0:00:17.83,TL,,0,0,0,,一月的墨尔本 他离决赛只差一步
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.83,0:00:19.05,TL,,0,0,0,,面对阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.05,0:00:21.39,TL,,0,0,0,,他从两盘落后追到{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.39,0:00:23.72,TL,,0,0,0,,却还是输掉了第五盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.72,0:00:27.22,TL,,0,0,0,,赛季的第一个大满贯 止步{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.95,0:00:41.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A moment of brilliance from Carlos Alcaraz{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯神来一笔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.09,0:00:45.15,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}secures a place in his very first{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N锁定职业生涯首次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.15,0:00:47.29,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Australian Open final.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N澳网决赛席位
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.72,0:00:50.51,TL,,0,0,0,,印第安维尔斯 迈阿密 蒙特卡洛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.51,0:00:53.08,TL,,0,0,0,,连续三站大师赛 都打进{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.08,0:00:55.30,TL,,0,0,0,,也连续{\fs78}3{\fs68}次输给辛纳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.30,0:00:57.46,TL,,0,0,0,,慕尼黑又止步{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.46,0:00:59.96,TL,,0,0,0,,他还没有拿到单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.40,0:01:01.61,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}月的马德里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.61,0:01:04.38,TL,,0,0,0,,他终于闯进本赛季第一场单打决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.38,0:01:06.66,TL,,0,0,0,,等在对面的还是辛纳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.66,0:01:09.79,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 又一次失利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.24,0:01:12.96,TL,,0,0,0,,真正的突破 发生在巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:14.59,TL,,0,0,0,,法网决赛对科博利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.59,0:01:16.77,TL,,0,0,0,,前{\fs78}4{\fs68}盘打成{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.77,0:01:17.55,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.55,0:01:20.80,TL,,0,0,0,,第五盘的{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}属于兹维列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.24,0:01:48.65,TL,,0,0,0,,等了{\fs78}5{\fs68}个多月的赛季单打首冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.65,0:01:51.01,TL,,0,0,0,,也是他生涯的第一座大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.01,0:01:54.52,TL,,0,0,0,,这次 他终于把奖杯抱在了怀里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.97,0:01:57.61,TL,,0,0,0,,温网 他又一次打进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.61,0:02:01.14,TL,,0,0,0,,先赢一盘 辛纳却拿走了后面{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.14,0:02:03.89,TL,,0,0,0,,巴黎突破之后 草地上的这道关
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.89,0:02:06.18,TL,,0,0,0,,他还是没能跨过去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:20.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}How about that! How about that!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太精彩了！太精彩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.34,0:02:24.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sweet set-up.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N漂亮的铺垫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.66,0:02:27.94,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Another forehand, crushed.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又一记正手 重重压下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.82,0:02:34.26,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Four sets of compelling tennis{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}4{\fs68}盘扣人心弦的网球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.26,0:02:37.86,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to finish up Wimbledon 2026.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N为{\fs78}2026{\fs68}温网收官
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.88,0:02:41.90,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A final to remember.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一场值得铭记的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.63,0:02:48.79,TL,,0,0,0,,就在加拿大首战出局之后 {\fs78}8{\fs68}月{\fs78}6{\fs68}日
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.79,0:02:52.04,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}ATP{\fs68}正式宣布他入围年终总决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:53.33,TL,,0,0,0,,都灵门票到手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.33,0:02:55.97,TL,,0,0,0,,他的赛季还没有到最高点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:03:00.12,TL,,0,0,0,,纽约 他连续第三项大满贯闯进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.12,0:03:02.10,TL,,0,0,0,,面对谢尔顿 先拿两盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.10,0:03:03.49,TL,,0,0,0,,再被追回一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.49,0:03:06.01,TL,,0,0,0,,最后以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}收下第四盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.01,0:03:06.89,TL,,0,0,0,,比赛结束
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.89,0:03:09.96,TL,,0,0,0,,他竟然没发现自己已经赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:18.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set and match, Zverev.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束 兹维列夫获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.02,0:03:23.28,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}[Umpire announces the score]{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N【裁判宣布比分】
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.28,0:03:24.66,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Zverev doesn't know he's won.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N兹维列夫还不知道自己赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.32,0:03:27.06,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He doesn't even know he's won.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他甚至没意识到自己赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.78,0:03:29.58,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}There you go.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这下知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.24,0:03:37.62,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He really didn't know.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他真的不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.06,0:03:41.82,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He was so focused in on just holding serve.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他一心只想着保发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:44.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He didn't know he was at the finish line,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他不知道自己已到终点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:48.12,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and he finishes off Ben Shelton in four sets{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}4{\fs68}盘击败谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.12,0:03:52.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and wins his second major of the year,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拿下年度第二座大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:54.90,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}his first US Open.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他的首个美网冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.70,0:03:58.23,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}月之前 单打还没有冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.23,0:04:00.69,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}月已经握住两座大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.69,0:04:02.57,TL,,0,0,0,,他今年的两座单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.57,0:04:04.49,TL,,0,0,0,,都来自大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.94,0:04:08.13,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}12{\fs68}日 他提前锁定年终第一
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.13,0:04:10.83,TL,,0,0,0,,但冠军之后 也会疲惫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.83,0:04:14.36,TL,,0,0,0,,他自己说 美网后总共只休息了一天
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.36,0:04:16.35,TL,,0,0,0,,上海半决赛先赢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.35,0:04:18.50,TL,,0,0,0,,还是被福基纳逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.22,0:04:27.34,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}For the second time in his career,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N职业生涯第二次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.32,0:04:30.70,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Alejandro Davidovich Fokina{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N达维多维奇 福基纳
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.70,0:04:34.44,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}is into the final of a Masters 1000.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N打进了大师赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:38.09,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}2{\fs68}日 他第一次登上世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.09,0:04:39.72,TL,,0,0,0,,提前锁定年终第一
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.72,0:04:41.70,TL,,0,0,0,,到真正站上周榜榜首
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.70,0:04:43.90,TL,,0,0,0,,这是两个不同的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.34,0:04:47.09,TL,,0,0,0,,维也纳止步{\fs78}4{\fs68}强之后 他来到巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.09,0:04:50.36,TL,,0,0,0,,却以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} {\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}输给穆塞蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.36,0:04:52.82,TL,,0,0,0,,世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}的首战失利 下一站
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.82,0:04:56.49,TL,,0,0,0,,是{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}15{\fs68}日开始的都灵总决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.94,0:04:58.24,TL,,0,0,0,,从一冠难求
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:05:00.92,TL,,0,0,0,,到两座大满贯和世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:01.90,TL,,0,0,0,,到了都灵
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.90,0:05:04.69,TL,,0,0,0,,兹维列夫还能继续突破吗？
